 "purpose": "The shared model of an exercise topic: Vraag (a question) and Onderwerp (the base class every topic extends).",
 "details": "A topic belongs to one skill and knows how to make a question from its leerlijn, check it, recognise thinking errors (diagnose), explain, give hints, give a worked solution in scratch-pad lines (oplossing) and make a similar question for the repeat bin. The terminal (terminal/oefenaar.py) only uses these methods, so a new topic is a subclass plus a leerlijn JSON plus an import in catalogus.py. Creating an instance registers the skill, its thinking errors and itself in ONDERWERPEN. Several methods are meant to be overridden (maak_met, uitleg, diagnose, oplossing, kolom_hulp, kies_onderwerp, onderwerp_van_sleutel).",
 "module_docstring": "Het gemeenschappelijke model voor een oefenonderwerp (vraag → antwoord).",
